{"id": "22623", "title": "楚辞", "author": "屈原", "category": "文学名著", "count": 65, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22623/22623s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/22/22623.htm", "intro": "“楚辞”又称“楚词”，是战国时代的伟大诗人屈原创造的一种诗体。作品运用楚地（今两湖一带）的文学样式、方言声韵，叙写楚地的山川人物、历史风情，具有浓厚的地方特色。汉代时，刘向把屈原的作品及宋玉等人“承袭屈赋”的作品编辑成集，名为《楚辞》。并成为继《诗经》以后，对我国文学具有深远影响的一部诗歌总集。", "base": "files/article/html/22/22623", "chapters": [{"title": "离骚", "file": "1657572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 东皇太一", "file": "1657573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 云中君", "file": "1657574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 湘君", "file": "1657575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 湘夫人", "file": "1657576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 大司命", "file": "1657577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 少司命", "file": "1657578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 东君", "file": "1657579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 河伯", "file": "1657580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 山鬼", "file": "1657581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 国殇", "file": "1657582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九歌 礼魂", "file": "1657583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天问", "file": "1657584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 惜诵", "file": "1657585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 涉江", "file": "1657586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 哀郢", "file": "1657587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 抽思", "file": "1657588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 怀沙", "file": "1657589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 思美人", "file": "1657590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 惜往日", "file": "1657591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 橘颂", "file": "1657592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九章 悲回风", "file": "1657593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "远游", "file": "1657594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卜居", "file": "1657595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "渔父", "file": "1657596.html", "av